STARTFONT 2.1
COMMENT The X11 misc-fixed 6x10 font (6x10.bdf, SHA-256 bb14d95828990eb3ada68a24d716ae640a674cd75ab6caca17c798e4cb385849),
COMMENT every pixel made two by two by cargo xtask misc-fixed (REQ-2223).
